---
import Layout from "../layouts/default.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";

const pageTitle = "My About";
---

<Layout>
  <h1 class="visually-hidden">About Me</h1>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="wrapper about__wrapper">
      <div class="about__column1">
        <div class="about__rich-content">
          <h2 class="about__rich-content-heading">Me as personal</h2>
          <p>
            When I’m not in front of my laptop and pc. Sometimes I do run,
            traveling, and ride my green bike. As you can see, most of my photos
            is green and blue. Even my bike is green! Its because I love nature
            and summer color. Of course, live my life as a designer made me
            close with coffee things. While traveling, I’m so excited to explore
            new coffeeshop, coffee beans, coffee roastery, and many things about
            coffee. So don’t be surprised when you come to Bali and see me
            working as a barista in a coffeeshop. That’s one of my hobby. What
            are the other? I love photography, book binding, writing, & reading.
            These hobbies help me to improve my self as a creative person.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about__rich-content">
          <h2 class="about__rich-content-heading">Work</h2>
          <p>
            My journey began in 2016 as a Graphic Design Intern at Kesato.co. I
            later worked as a Photo Editor at Inggrid Angelia Photography,
            combining my love for visual storytelling with photography. When the
            pandemic hit in 2019, I used the disruption as a chance to rethink
            my direction. I began learning UI/UX, website development, and
            product design, gradually moving from creating visuals to thinking
            more deeply about how those visuals work within a bigger experience.
            In 2021, I joined Fugazi.co as a Design Strategist, where I’ve been
            working with teams and business owners to shape brands, digital
            products, and visual experiences ever since. Outside of work, I
            freelance on website projects and occasionally pick up a camera
            again.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about__rich-content">
          <h2 class="about__rich-content-heading">Clients & Collaborations</h2>
          <div class="about__logo-grid">
            <Icon
              name="logos/Analog-Id"
              class="logo"
              width="156.67px"
              height="auto"
            />
            <Icon
              name="logos/Studio Fondue"
              class="logo"
              width="156.67px"
              height="auto"
            /><Icon
              name="logos/ASC"
              class="logo"
              width="156.67px"
              height="auto"
            /><Icon
              name="logos/Sradha Coffee"
              class="logo"
              width="156.67px"
              height="auto"
            /><Icon
              name="logos/Tone App"
              class="logo"
              width="156.67px"
              height="auto"
            /><Icon
              name="logos/Catalyze"
              class="logo"
              width="156.67px"
              height="auto"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about__column2">
        <img
          src="/src/assets/IMG_1239 2.png"
          alt="Photo of Aditya Pramana"
          class="about__photo"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about__wrapper {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    column-gap: 6.75rem;
    row-gap: var(--padding-80);
  }

  .about__rich-content {
    padding-block-end: var(--padding-80);
  }

  .about__rich-content:last-child {
    padding-block-end: inherit;
  }

  .about__rich-content-heading {
    padding-block-end: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about__logo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid: 1fr 1fr / 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  }

  .about__photo {
    position: sticky;
    top: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .about__wrapper {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-template-rows: 1fr auto;
    }

    .about__column2 {
      grid-row: -1 / 1;
    }

    .about__photo {
      position: inherit;
    }
  }
</style>
